## 📦 Features

### ✅ **v4.6.1 LTS** (Current - Production Stable)

- **OpenUSD Pipeline**: Full USD/USDC/USDA export/import
- **Universal glTF/GLB I/O**: Optimized for web, game engines, AR/VR
- **Multi-DCC Support**: Maya (production), 3ds Max & Blender (coming v5.1)
- **Smart Export System**: One-click export to multiple platforms
- **Real-Time Validation**: Shader-based topology error detection
- **Version Control**: Git and Perforce integration
- **Industry 4.0 IoT**: MQTT/OPC-UA digital twin sync

### 🔜 **v5.0 AI Compute Layer** (Q3 2026)

- **Material Synthesis**: Text/photo → PBR materials (AI)
- **Neural Mesh Optimization**: Graph Neural Network retopology
- **Procedural Animation**: Physics-based + reinforcement learning
- **Cloud AI Processing**: Offload GPU-intensive tasks

### 🔮 **v6.0 Antigravity Intelligence** (Q2 2027)

- **Generative 3D**: Text → 3D model (Point-E, Shap-E)
- **Anomaly Detection**: Computer vision for topology errors
- **Voice Control**: Natural language modeling (Whisper + GPT-4)
- **Autonomous Workflows**: Self-optimizing pipelines

